{"steam_appid":4126220,"steam_name":"Crusaders Quest : Hero Town","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4126220/1286882473/e35bf107cb65c487296a2a2ffcdc6e2668bdafd6/1774427480/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1774427918","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257262152/3cc264e8af50b053dc8d7eb419fb3f3edfb4fce8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1774427918","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/792cf46b6519d92141ba66540ad7d44ce3388dff/ss_792cf46b6519d92141ba66540ad7d44ce3388dff.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786277008","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/9fe99d8159c2628cdaf7442e5281e49ee02a8390/ss_9fe99d8159c2628cdaf7442e5281e49ee02a8390.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786277008","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/16c5fbfdafd79328ea3e0da97c1dca7008dbe78c/ss_16c5fbfdafd79328ea3e0da97c1dca7008dbe78c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786277008","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/bc4056f8507ee5e51db82adfdac5d672702fdb06/ss_bc4056f8507ee5e51db82adfdac5d672702fdb06.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786277008","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/48a6dfaa6b1170ab1a2028a9da5bf8e92c70a53e/ss_48a6dfaa6b1170ab1a2028a9da5bf8e92c70a53e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786277008"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Little Town on Your PC, 《Crusaders Quest : Hero Town》</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/4dfbf5597795f07b8be258696db30956.poster.avif?t=1786277008\" width=752 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/4dfbf5597795f07b8be258696db30956.webm?t=1786277008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/4dfbf5597795f07b8be258696db30956.mp4?t=1786277008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A desktop idle RPG that accompanies your work and daily life!</strong> Just keep it open on the side of your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute pixel heroes will automatically gather and your town will gradually grow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heroes are gathering!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/d58a372aed1a6e3916e45e667798fd7b.poster.avif?t=1786277008\" width=494 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/d58a372aed1a6e3916e45e667798fd7b.webm?t=1786277008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/d58a372aed1a6e3916e45e667798fd7b.mp4?t=1786277008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite heroes and assemble a hero party in your town.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The town keeps growing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/e66d770946d78a05ce93fcd0fa004d11.poster.avif?t=1786277008\" width=866 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/e66d770946d78a05ce93fcd0fa004d11.webm?t=1786277008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/e66d770946d78a05ce93fcd0fa004d11.mp4?t=1786277008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct buildings that help your hero party, and decorate Hero Town to provide a resting place for your heroes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle monsters around the town!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/659e7297aab5d13c7daf1f0adb813046.poster.avif?t=1786277008\" width=1082 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/659e7297aab5d13c7daf1f0adb813046.webm?t=1786277008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/659e7297aab5d13c7daf1f0adb813046.mp4?t=1786277008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes fight and grow stronger by battling monsters around the town.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn resources through battles against various monsters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit even cooler heroes and help them grow!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/78cb5f422c17cae2c354538b974e1e02.poster.avif?t=1786277008\" width=820 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/78cb5f422c17cae2c354538b974e1e02.webm?t=1786277008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/78cb5f422c17cae2c354538b974e1e02.mp4?t=1786277008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes become even more impressive through promotion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And upgrade your town's heroes through the growth skill tree.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather fruits around the town!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/5c8065afebb339b8db78c97fbaa32ad6.poster.avif?t=1786277008\" width=864 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/5c8065afebb339b8db78c97fbaa32ad6.webm?t=1786277008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126220/extras/5c8065afebb339b8db78c97fbaa32ad6.mp4?t=1786277008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fruits from the orchards around the town and give them as gifts to your heroes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage and decorate your very own Hero Town!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen™ 3 1200 / Intel® Core™ i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon™ RX 460 / NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen™ 3 1200 / Intel® Core™ i5-6400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon™ RX 470 / Intel® Arc™ A750 / NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1060 6GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","RPG","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["CQ LABS"],"publishers":[" LoadComplete"],"release_date":"30 Mar, 2026"}